## SQ-JFP-01 | pump water from a Create tank into a Supplementaries jar (both pump directions tried)
# layout at x+400 (forceloaded): tank T, pump P (small cog, axis x), jar J along +x; cogwheel above P, creative motor
# above T facing east drives it. Create's flow direction depends on facing and rotation sign, so each phase is run
# with the pump facing east and then west; one of them fills the jar (JFP-01), the next drains it back (JFP-02).
> fill {S5H1+399} {S5H2} {S5H3-1} {S5H1+403} {S5H2+2} {S5H3+1} minecraft:air
> setblock {S5H1+400} {S5H2} {S5H3} create:fluid_tank
sleep 2
> data merge block {S5H1+400} {S5H2} {S5H3} {TankContent:{FluidName:"minecraft:water",Amount:4000}}
> setblock {S5H1+402} {S5H2} {S5H3} supplementaries:jar
> setblock {S5H1+401} {S5H2} {S5H3} create:mechanical_pump[facing=east]
> setblock {S5H1+401} {S5H2+1} {S5H3} create:cogwheel[axis=x]
> setblock {S5H1+400} {S5H2+1} {S5H3} create:creative_motor[facing=east]
> setblock {S5H1+401} {S5H2} {S5H3} create:mechanical_pump[facing=east]
sleep 30
> say JFP phase 1 pump east
> data get block {S5H1+402} {S5H2} {S5H3}
> data get block {S5H1+400} {S5H2} {S5H3} TankContent
expect has the following block data: .*FluidHolder
reject (Unknown (item|block|block type|entity)|does not (have|accept)|Incorrect argument for command|Unknown or incomplete command|That position is not loaded|No player was found|no such bot|no such item|Invalid (block state|tag)|\[(zq|s5)\] (error|no player))
look phase 1 or phase 2 (next row) ends with the jar FluidHolder water, count 12, and the tank down to 1000 mB; no Error occurred line

